  "userGuide": "User guide",
  "guideHeroTitle": "Welcome to MooMoo",
  "guideHeroBody": "This guide walks you step by step through everything you can do in the app: translate, explore the dictionary, learn sign language and manage your account.",
  "guideContents": "Contents",
  "guideOpen": "Open: {section}",
  "guideMoreHelpTitle": "Need more help?",
  "guideMoreHelpBody": "Browse the FAQ or contact the team from the help center.",
  "guideAccountTitle": "Create an account",
  "guideAccountIntro": "An account saves your favorites, progress and history.",
  "guideAccountSteps": "On the welcome screen, choose \"Create an account\".\nEnter your name, email address and a password.\nIf you receive a confirmation email, open the link inside.\nYou can complete your profile at any time afterwards.",
  "guideLoginTitle": "Sign in",
  "guideLoginIntro": "Find your data on all your devices.",
  "guideLoginSteps": "Enter your email address and password, then confirm.\nForgot your password? Tap \"Forgot password\" to receive a reset link by email.\nTo sign out, open your profile and choose \"Sign out\".",
  "guideNavigationTitle": "Getting around",
  "guideNavigationIntro": "The navigation bar gives access to the four main areas.",
  "guideNavigationSteps": "Home: shortcuts and daily suggestions.\nDictionary: the sign dictionary.\nLearn: your lesson path.\nTranslate: translation between signs and text.\nProfile: on phones, the last tab of the bottom bar; on computers and tablets, your photo at the top right.\nOn phones, the round button in the middle of the bottom bar opens translation; tap it again to start or stop the capture.",
  "guideTranslateTitle": "Translate",
  "guideTranslateIntro": "Translate signs into text, or text into signs.",
  "guideTranslateSteps": "Open the Translate tab and choose the direction.\nSigns to text: allow camera access, make sure you are well lit and framed, then sign.\nText to signs: type or dictate a sentence to see the matching signs.\nIf recognition is temporarily unavailable, a message tells you so: try again a little later.",
  "guideDictionaryTitle": "Dictionary",
  "guideDictionaryIntro": "Explore signs by search or by category.",
  "guideDictionarySteps": "Type a word in the search bar or browse categories.\nTap a sign to see its video and description.\nAdd it to your favorites to find it easily from your profile.",
  "guideLearningTitle": "Learn",
  "guideLearningIntro": "Progress at your own pace with short lessons.",
  "guideLearningSteps": "Open the Learn tab to see your path.\nPick the available lesson and complete the exercises.\nYour progress is saved automatically.\nCheck your statistics on the progress screen.",
  "guideProfileTitle": "Profile and photo",
  "guideProfileIntro": "Personalize the information shown on your account.",
  "guideProfileSteps": "Open your profile, then \"Edit profile\".\nTap \"Add a photo\" or \"Change photo\" and pick an image (JPG, PNG, WebP, GIF or BMP).\nIt is resized automatically, even if it is a large camera photo.\nThe photo is saved and shown right away.\nTo remove it, tap \"Remove photo\" and confirm.\nRemember to save your other changes.",
  "guideHistoryTitle": "History",
  "guideHistoryIntro": "Find your previous translations.",
  "guideHistorySteps": "Open your profile, then \"Translation history\".\nBrowse your recent translations, newest first.\nHistory is tied to your account: sign in to see it.",
  "guideSettingsTitle": "Settings",
  "guideSettingsIntro": "Adapt the app to your preferences.",
  "guideSettingsSteps": "Light or dark theme and app language.\nSign language used for translation and the dictionary.\nDefault view and 3D character settings.\nAccessibility options and account security (password change).",
  "guideRolesTitle": "Roles",
  "guideRolesIntro": "Some features depend on the role assigned to your account.",
  "guideRolesSteps": "User: translate, browse the dictionary, learn and suggest signs.\nTeacher: manage learning content from their space.\nExpert: review signs and submitted contributions.\nAdministrator: manage users, the dictionary and app settings.\nYour available spaces appear in your profile.",
  "guideErrorsTitle": "Common issues",
  "guideErrorsIntro": "What to do if something does not work?",
  "guideErrorsSteps": "\"Unable to connect\": check your internet connection and try again.\n\"Session expired\": sign in again.\n\"Camera not available\": allow the camera in your device or browser settings.\n\"Image too large or unsupported format\": pick a JPG, PNG or WebP image under 2 MB.\n\"Maintenance\": the app will be back soon, try again later.\nStill stuck? Contact us from the help center."
}
